<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oObject<dd>the object to add the specified command<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">cCommand<dd>the command to add to the object<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">bAddToFront<dd>specifies if the command should be added to the front of the queue or not<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">bStatic<dd>whether or not the command will be added as a static command. Static commands are flagged in a special manner and cannot be removed via regular clearing functionality. An override must specifically be specified to remove static commands. As such, commands should only be specified as static if they absolutely must finish<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nOverrideAddBehavior<dd>replace the default add behavior by specifying a new behavior here
